  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S8-M  STEALTH / CAMOUFLAGE
  body: 'Press G for labels. Press 3 (Melee), press Z to target the hunter, and TAP
    once: it is aware and faces you, so the troop is COUNTERED.

    Now press C:
    the Melee troops get a cyan ball above them (concealed). TAP again.

    EXPECT:
    BYPASS: CONCEALED, and the troop attaches. Press C again to reveal and the counter
    returns. Ranged and other troop types are not concealed by C.'
  radius: 3
