  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S3-F  TROOP CAPACITY
  body: 'Press G for the debug labels. Press 3 (Melee) and TAP once: one troop goes
    out.

    EXPECT: three enemies are nearby but only ONE attacks it (label ATTACKED
    1/1). The other two wait. Now press 2 (Ranged) and tap once: up to TWO enemies
    attack it (ATTACKED 2/2).

    Limits: Melee 1, Ranged 2, Medic 2, Builder 3.'
  radius: 3
