  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6dffaeb1f6b7ca4cb5ce48f87980a3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S8-L  SIZE LINEUP
  body: 'Walk north (+Z) about 20 units: four enemies stand in a row, smallest to
    largest. They are passive, so you can look closely.

    EXPECT: size, health
    and attach points grow together. Press Z on each one: the counter shows 3, 4,
    5, 6. Press G to see their health (600, 600, 1500, 3000). The miniboss is clearly
    bigger than you, and the boss is bigger again.

    To see the attack wind-up
    (enemy grows, tints orange, red disc on the ground), fight the miniboss at S8-H
    or the boss at S8-I.'
  radius: 3
